    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="0818" n="758" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg758"/>

                <head>Mr. Washburn to Señor Benitez.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Asuncion,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 26, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have just received the inclosed
                    communication from Mr. P. C. Bliss, which, at his request, I forward to your
                    honor. It treats of a matter that occurred before my return to Paraguay, and of
                    which I never heard till the day before yesterday, when he told me he would
                    write this statement. Whether it will be of any use to the government I am
                    unable to say. Hoping, however, that it may be, I comply with Mr. Bliss’s
                    request, and forward it immediately.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to renew assurances of distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES A. WASHBURN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gumesindo Benitez,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Minister of Foreign Affairs.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
